{
  "source": "course-assets/in-your-hands/in-your-hands.mp4",
  "duration": 183.616,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.12,
      "text": "You hear it constantly right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.6,
      "end": 4.04,
      "text": "AI is taking jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.86,
      "end": 7.44,
      "text": "That headline used to be a prediction about the future,"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.88,
      "end": 10.22,
      "text": "but today, it is just the daily news."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.88,
      "end": 12.42,
      "text": "Jobs are the loudest headline."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.3,
      "end": 15.46,
      "text": "The impact extends far beyond the workplace."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.34,
      "end": 20.88,
      "text": "AI shifts who holds power, consumes fast planetary resources"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.4,
      "end": 24.86,
      "text": "and challenges the nature of what you can actually trust online."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.54,
      "end": 28.9,
      "text": "Which way all of this goes, nobody actually knows."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.9,
      "end": 31.5,
      "text": "Even the people building these systems are guessing."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.24,
      "end": 34.78,
      "text": "And almost none of that trajectory is in your control."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.26,
      "end": 40.38,
      "text": "So, looking at this board, here is the exact question worth asking."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.04,
      "end": 42.64,
      "text": "What is actually in your hands?"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.16,
      "end": 43.84,
      "text": "And what isn't?"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.22,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "Let's start on the left side of this framework."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.72,
      "end": 49.44,
      "text": "This entire column represents external events."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.16,
      "end": 52.86,
      "text": "You do not dictate how AI will change future jobs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.28,
      "end": 55.3,
      "text": "how quickly the underlying technology evolves,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.9,
      "end": 58.64,
      "text": "or the massive volume of work a machine can suddenly"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.64,
      "end": 58.98,
      "text": "produce."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.76,
      "end": 62.6,
      "text": "You don't get a say in how other people use AI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.12,
      "end": 65.66,
      "text": "or what the media decides the next headline predicts."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.42,
      "end": 67.42,
      "text": "Now look at the right side."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 69.9,
      "text": "This is your actual zone of control."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.8,
      "end": 74.52,
      "text": "First, you can choose to build real depth in a subject you care about."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.84,
      "end": 77.58,
      "text": "You can choose to stay curious as the landscape shifts."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.18,
      "end": 80.98,
      "text": "And as you test new things, you can actively decide"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.98,
      "end": 84.5,
      "text": "to keep only the methods and tools that consistently work for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.78,
      "end": 87.72,
      "text": "You can practice coming up with your own original ideas."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.72,
      "end": 91.06,
      "text": "Instead of outsourcing your thinking entirely to a machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.86,
      "end": 95.02,
      "text": "You choose exactly how you integrate AI into your workflow,"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.5,
      "end": 97.42,
      "text": "and how you collaborate with the people around you."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.04,
      "end": 100.84,
      "text": "Finally, choose to make something real right now,"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.08,
      "end": 104.0,
      "text": "rather than passively waiting to see what happens to the industry."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.74,
      "end": 106.48,
      "text": "You do not control every outcome,"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.94,
      "end": 108.5,
      "text": "but your choices still matter."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.06,
      "end": 111.42,
      "text": "Keeping informed about the left column is fine,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.78,
      "end": 115.14,
      "text": "but you need to put most of your daily energy into the right."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.34,
      "end": 119.02,
      "text": "That right column is a strict to-do list,"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.4,
      "end": 121.76,
      "text": "broken down into three moves worth your energy."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.58,
      "end": 123.78,
      "text": "Move one is to go deep."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.5,
      "end": 127.12,
      "text": "Pick one specific AI tool and master it."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.6,
      "end": 129.16,
      "text": "Learn exactly what it does well,"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.44,
      "end": 131.64,
      "text": "where it makes mistakes, and push its limits."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.56,
      "end": 134.8,
      "text": "Deep expertise beats superficial dabbling."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.62,
      "end": 136.98,
      "text": "Move two is to think first."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.6,
      "end": 140.74,
      "text": "Form your own opinion on a problem before you ever type a prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.44,
      "end": 144.46,
      "text": "Then use the AI to interrogate and sharpen your thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.46,
      "end": 148.26,
      "text": "That is the mechanical difference between genuinely getting smarter"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.26,
      "end": 150.22,
      "text": "and merely retrieving answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.94,
      "end": 152.54,
      "text": "Move three is to skip the hype."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.06,
      "end": 155.46,
      "text": "You cannot control what the new cycle pushes today,"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.84,
      "end": 159.1,
      "text": "but you dictate whether you spend an hour doom-scrolling headlines"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.1,
      "end": 162.3,
      "text": "or spend that hour getting better at a tangible skill."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.88,
      "end": 166.72,
      "text": "Applying these moves guarantees you put effort where it changes your outcome."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.76,
      "end": 171.34,
      "text": "The cultural conversation around AI is deafening right now,"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.34,
      "end": 174.18,
      "text": "and you cannot control where the technology goes next,"
    },
    {
      "start": 174.68,
      "end": 178.4,
      "text": "but you can build the skill and the judgment to decide what you do next."
    }
  ],
